  "what": "Lines on the front band of the top shell, each a segment marked by hand along it; spike.py fits each line. O2-FL: the band's ends are the corners' vertical edges, its top the case top's near long edge (from \"case\"), its bottom where the bottom shell starts, either side of the black strip; the door's left side is the middle of the dark gap beside it, its right side the black strip's left edge; POWER's left edge and RESET's right edge on the bottom shell. O4: the PAL top shell, taken apart, straight on: its band's four edges, the door's left gap and the black block's left edge."
 },
